22. D[UB.9.K]AM@v ša₂ naq#-bi e-mu-ru EŠ₂#.GAR₃# {d#}G[IŠ-gim₂-maš]
#tr.en: Tablet [IX], ‘He who saw the Deeps’, series of Gilgameš.
23. KUR {m}AN.ŠAR₂-DU₃-A
#tr.en.(r vi 24): Palace of Aššurbanipal, king of the world, king of Assyria.
24. MAN ŠU₂ MAN AN.ŠAR₂{ki}
$ end of side
#note: See @bib{RN117@737 fn. 4}: “The property label, which is Assurbanipal colophon a = @bib{RN497@no. 317}, with minor orthographic variants, was incised on the tablet after the clay had hardened.”

